{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/GAME.png?t=1752567282\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Treat or Trick \u2b50 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hallowanderband is a rhythm-action adventure game driven by Halloween-themed stories.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The Fellowship of the Hallowanderband has been founded!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/\uc560\ub2c8\uba54\uc774\uc158.gif?t=1752567282\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Apprentice reaper Ryoul arrives in Hallowonderland for work, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">but overwhelmed by endless tasks, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">decides to pursue a long-held dream\u2014joining the Halloween parade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Ryoul\u2019s journey to form the Hallowanderband, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">meeting all kinds of characters along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Happenings in the marching band</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/\uc778\uac8c\uc784_202504.gif?t=1752567282\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hit the round note tracks on the left and right in time with the rhythm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy dynamic animations and immerse yourself in the colorful episodes of each character!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Ta-Da!!!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/\uc9dc\uc794_202504.gif?t=1752567282\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whenever the story gets intense, a sudden event will happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your wits to overcome the 'Ta-Da' events that vary from episode to episode!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What we need is, the background story!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/\ub300\ud654_202504.gif?t=1752567282\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Come listen to the stories your characters have to tell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through dialogues, you'll get to know these fascinating characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and experience their deeper stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3127030?t=1752567282","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752567282","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752567282","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752567282","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127030/extras/GAME.png?t=1752567282\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Treat or Trick \u2b50 </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hallowanderband is a rhythm-action adventure game driven by Halloween-themed stories.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_pa